#. 6.2->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-backdrop->tooltip
#. 6.7.6->settings-schema.json->aperture-panels-backdrop->tooltip
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"What is seen behind the panels as they turn. Wallpaper: the desktop stays in "
"place and only the windows behind are on the panels. Black void: the desktop "
"is on the panels too and flips with them, revealing a black void. "
"Transparent: nothing is drawn behind the panels, so the real screen shows "
"through the gaps. Star field: like Black void, with twinkling stars in the "
"void. Nebula: the star field with a colourful nebula behind the stars."
msgstr ""
"Hvad der ses bag panelerne, når de drejer. Skrivebordsbaggrund: Skrivebordet "
"forbliver på sin plads, og kun vinduerne bagved vises på panelerne. Sort "
"tomrum: Skrivebordet vises også på panelerne og drejer sammen med dem, "
"hvilket afslører et sort tomrum."

